---
description: Bind member acceptance or rejection to the specific proposed plot and duty terms.
args: { garden: GardenDossier; change: GardenChange; alternatives: PlotAlternative[] }
returns: AllocationNegotiation
---
Accept only a member response that identifies the proposal and terms. Silence, prior participation, or a general preference is not acceptance. Preserve partial acceptance by recording the accepted items separately from declined or unanswered assignments. Do not infer consent to another member's duty transfer.
